倚靠在墙上，电商摄影，自然光线，由香奈儿公司拍摄，胶片质感\n\n【主体】一位年轻的亚裔女性，穿着带有花卉图案的旗袍，佩戴多层珍珠项链和珍珠耳环，画着黑色眼线，黑色眼影，眼睛微微眯起\n【神态】眼神魅惑，红唇鲜艳，透着一种风情万种又略带神秘的感觉\n【行为】手持老式电话听筒，另一只手夹着香烟，体态慵懒又放松\n【环境】昏暗的复古房间，有台灯、镜子等陈设\n【光影】暖色调的灯光营造出氛围感，光线柔和地洒在人物身上\n【色彩】以暖色调为主，旗袍的色彩丰富且艳丽，与环境的暗色调形成对比\n【情绪】充满复古的韵味与妩媚的气息，仿佛在诉说着一段故事\n【风格】具有老上海的复古风格，画面精致细腻，充满怀旧感\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [400.3947448730469, 356.5640869140625], "pos": [-1646.161865234375, 569.79638671875], "id": 31, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [56], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [280.3668212890625, 89.25678253173828], "pos": [-182.8671875, 189.12466430664062], "widgets_values": ["专业换脸相识度高达99%的qwen edit_V1.safetensors", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 27, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.62", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.2.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"lora_name": true, "strength_model": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [10], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [210, 277.1960754394531], "pos": [883.8265991210938, 346.12042236328125], "widgets_values": [7, "randomize", 9, 1, "euler_ancestral", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 57, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 5, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "nega